# Safety & Secrets

- Never commit `.env`, `.streamlit/secrets.toml`, API keys, or client birth data dumps.
- Do not promise health cures, investment returns, or legal outcomes in report copy or prompts.
- Treat birth data as sensitive PII; avoid writing it into repo fixtures with real identities.
- Org and personal reports are entertainment/guidance tooling — keep language non-absolute (“indicates”, “favours”, “window”).
